(6755403, 1012623, 43463, '<td valign="top">Stunning macro shot! I might be the only one who sees this as an an example of anthropomorphises. The dandelion on the top left corner seems to be ''stretching'' it''s arm/branch seed to touch the tip of the grass/fingertip. Great details in your main subjects. My only critique, and it''s a small one mind you, is that I wish that the blade of grass was coming out from the bottom right hand corner so the reach would be a full diagonal.</td>', 'Stunning macro shot! I might be the only one who sees this as an an example of anthropomorphises. The dandelion on the top left corner seems to be ''stretching'' it''s arm/branch seed to touch the tip of the grass/fingertip. Great details in your main subjects. My only critique, and it''s a small one mind you, is that I wish that the blade of grass was coming out from the bottom right hand corner so the reach would be a full diagonal.', '2012-04-30 10:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
