(6755559, 1012547, 43463, '<td valign="top">Ha, I had a similiar idea. Glad that I went with my other of three ideas as that now your''s can have the full spotlight. I love the ''casual'' glance of the men as they pretend to read the newspaper (Nope, not me I''m not looking at her, I''m just ah reading this article...yeah) I do like the detail of the shirt the woman is wearing "Boyfriend Season is Here". The question becomes who is ''scoping out'' who - the lady or the men? She has a smirk/smile on her face that projects to me that she ''knows'' that they are checking her out...which is exactly where she wants them. Just noticed another little detail - "Prime Mare" is the headline on one of the newspapers. That headline can play so well into this shot as that it makes you wonder who will win this ''derby race'' - one of the guys or the girl? The girl methinks;-) Very well done (8).</td>', 'Ha, I had a similiar idea. Glad that I went with my other of three ideas as that now your''s can have the full spotlight. I love the ''casual'' glance of the men as they pretend to read the newspaper (Nope, not me I''m not looking at her, I''m just ah reading this article...yeah) I do like the detail of the shirt the woman is wearing "Boyfriend Season is Here". The question becomes who is ''scoping out'' who - the lady or the men? She has a smirk/smile on her face that projects to me that she ''knows'' that they are checking her out...which is exactly where she wants them. Just noticed another little detail - "Prime Mare" is the headline on one of the newspapers. That headline can play so well into this shot as that it makes you wonder who will win this ''derby race'' - one of the guys or the girl? The girl methinks;-) Very well done (8).', '2012-04-30 13:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
