(6761815, 1011459, 120171, '<td valign="top">For me it''s obvious the cat is upside down but you could also flick through the images and perceive that the cat is sat upright.<br/>I like detail on the cats face and it is nicely lit but the shallow dof is a bit too much for me.<br/>A good image but I think it fell into the unimaginative category (along with mine) and was probably voted lower than normal.</td>', 'For me it''s obvious the cat is upside down but you could also flick through the images and perceive that the cat is sat upright.I like detail on the cats face and it is nicely lit but the shallow dof is a bit too much for me.A good image but I think it fell into the unimaginative category (along with mine) and was probably voted lower than normal.', '2012-05-07 08:04:58.000000', NULL, 0),
