(6761842, 1011465, 3936, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Great job Lydia!  I have to look at this on my iPad, and turn it upside down to be able to really see it "correctly".  Even once I look at it from the real camera angle, it still rolls the eye, once I turn the iPad back.  You definitely deserve the blue on this one.  I love it!</td>', 'Wow!  Great job Lydia!  I have to look at this on my iPad, and turn it upside down to be able to really see it "correctly".  Even once I look at it from the real camera angle, it still rolls the eye, once I turn the iPad back.  You definitely deserve the blue on this one.  I love it!', '2012-05-07 08:30:51.000000', NULL, 0),
