(6761915, 1012673, 12611, '<td valign="top">Like the evolution of modern children, the reflection is expertly done, and makes me think, with dichotomies that a reflection can make in an image, soft to sharp, black and white to nothing but gray, they should be used more often. <br/> <br/>In a weirder, looking into it too much sense, this shows our split personalities, our inner and outer sides, the clearly perceived and the blurrier, softer sides, both at the same time, and perhaps it is fitting that the more obscure side is up?</td>', 'Like the evolution of modern children, the reflection is expertly done, and makes me think, with dichotomies that a reflection can make in an image, soft to sharp, black and white to nothing but gray, they should be used more often.  In a weirder, looking into it too much sense, this shows our split personalities, our inner and outer sides, the clearly perceived and the blurrier, softer sides, both at the same time, and perhaps it is fitting that the more obscure side is up?', '2012-05-07 10:15:23.000000', NULL, 0),
